            <ArticleTitle>[Accidental insertion of a temporary pacemaker electrode in the left ventricle: radiological and electrocardiographic diagnosis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1688-92</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of unintentional puncture of the subclavian artery and insertion of a temporary pacemaker electrode in the left ventricle. Therapeutic and diagnostic strategies of this rare complication of pacemaker therapy are discussed and recommendations for safe puncture of the subclavian vein are made.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
